B.abp=s(["Schedules can now contain only a start time, which is useful for reminders at a specific moment.","The cat helper no longer adds an automatic one-hour duration when it hears a single time.","Calendar, schedule, and dashboard views now display either a single time or a complete time range."],t.s)
